            "diagnosis_secondary.2",
            "diagnosis_secondary.3",
            "diagnosis_secondary.4"
          ],
          "text": "Primary: Necrotising soft-tissue infection, left thigh, with septic shock.\n\nSecondary:\n- ARDS\n- Acute kidney injury requiring CVVH\n- Line sepsis, day 14\n- New atrial fibrillation, rate-controlled\n- ICU-acquired weakness",
          "unverified_fact_ids": []
        },
        {
          "section_id": "sections.2",
          "part": "part_a",
          "heading": "key_investigations",
          "fact_ids": [
            "key_investigations.0"
          ],
          "text": "Wound organisms: Group A Streptococcus and anaerobes.",
          "unverified_fact_ids": []
        },
        {
          "section_id": "sections.3",
          "part": "part_a",
          "heading": "treatment",
          "fact_ids": [
            "treatment.0",
            "treatment.1",
            "treatment.2",
            "treatment.3",
            "treatment.4",
            "treatment.5",
            "treatment.6",
            "treatment.7",
            "treatment.8",
            "treatment.9"
          ],
          "text": "Multi-organ support was provided: the patient was intubated and ventilated, received noradrenaline, and underwent CVVH for AKI. Renal recovery occurred and CVVH was stopped on day 16. The patient was extubated on day 18 and stepped down to the ward on day 24.\n\nSurgical management comprised four debridements (days 0, 2, 5, and 9), followed by washout, delayed closure, and VAC dressing. Wound healing is ongoing by secondary intention with district nurse and tissue viability involvement.\n\nA long course of IV piperacillin-tazobactam was given, subsequently tailored to benzylpenicillin and clindamycin per microbiology advice.\n\nProne positioning was performed twice for ARDS.\n\nLines were changed for line sepsis on day 14.\n\nNutrition was provided via nasogastric tube, with improving oral intake thereafter.\n\nProlonged rehabilitation and physiotherapy were undertaken.",
          "unverified_fact_ids": []
        },
        {
