            "treatment.3",
            "treatment.4",
            "treatment.5",
            "treatment.6",
            "treatment.7",
            "treatment.8",
            "treatment.9"
          ],
          "text": "Wound cultures grew Group A Streptococcus and anaerobes. She required full multi-organ support including intubation and ventilation, noradrenaline, and CVVH for AKI. She underwent four surgical debridements (days 0, 2, 5, and 9) with washout, delayed closure, and VAC dressing; the wound is healing by secondary intention with district nurse and tissue viability input. Antibiotic therapy commenced with IV piperacillin-tazobactam and was subsequently tailored to benzylpenicillin and clindamycin per microbiology advice. Prone positioning was performed twice for ARDS. Lines were changed on day 14 for line sepsis. Nutrition was delivered via nasogastric tube with improving oral intake. Renal function recovered and CVVH was stopped on day 16; she was extubated on day 18 and stepped down to the ward on day 24. Prolonged rehabilitation and physiotherapy have been ongoing.",
